              "{\"articleBody\":\"“Maybe. Maybe. “It could happen.\",\"articleSection\":[\"business\"],\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Donna Borak\"}],\"dateModified\":\"2018-11-27T01:55:10Z\",\"headline\":\"Trump dims hopes of China trade deal with fresh tariff threat on Apple phones\",\"alternativeHeadline\":\"Trump hints at new tariffs on Apple in WSJ interview\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"CNN\",\"foundingDate\":\"1980-06-01\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/cnn/\",\"https://x.com/CNN\",\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cnn\",\"https://www.instagram.com/cnn/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/cnn\"]},\"timeRequired\":\"P0Y0M0DT0H2M31S\",\"wordCount\":567,\"video\":[{\"dateModified\":\"2018-10-23T15:21:14Z\",\"uploadDate\":\"2018-10-23T15:21:14Z\",\"duration\":\"PT00H03M09S\",\"caption\":[{\"encodingFormat\":\"vtt\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"encodingFormat\":\"srt\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}],\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"name\":\"The real cost of Trump's tariffs\",\"headline\":\"The real cost of Trump's tariffs\",\"description\":\"As the trade war between the U.S. and China intensifies, some American workers are already feeling the effects. We find out how Trump's tariffs are impacting workers in farming and manufacturing in the midwest.\"}],\"datePublished\":\"2018-11-26T23:34:52Z\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"hasPart\":{\"isAccessibleForFree\":false}}"
